{"parse": {"title": "CO-05", "pageid": 100914, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/CO-04\" title=\"CO-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">CO-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/CO-06\" title=\"CO-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">CO</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.B6.E9.97.B4.E7.AE.80.E8.B0.B1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"时间简谱\">时间简谱</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 时间简谱</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Score of Time</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>音<span class=\"color-value\"></span>符<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>遇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>全<span class=\"color-value\"></span>然<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>知<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>己<span class=\"color-value\"></span>将<span class=\"color-value\"></span>成<span class=\"color-value\"></span>为<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>首<span class=\"color-value\"></span>完<span class=\"color-value\"></span>全<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>歌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>曲<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2710105</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_zhangpeng.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_zhangpeng\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_zhangpeng\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-2_7_bg_zhangpeng.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_zhangpeng.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-2_7_bg_zhangpeng.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_zhangpeng.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-2_7_bg_zhangpeng.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_zhangpeng.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台节目：</div><div>“我们认为，旅行者一号也许将永远在银河系漫游……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台节目：</div><div>“它将带着人类探索的证明前往星空深处，很可能会比地球上的生灵存在得更为长久……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>收音机的播报总能吸引这位新朋友的注意力，她这几天都花上相当多的时间研究这个小方盒子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到有其他声音盖过播报声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>明天天气怎么样？如果是晴天，去散步的时候就能走得稍微远一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>你还没有见过米尔内的钻石矿对不对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩儿摇了摇头，把收音机放到旁边，等待库珀花环的下一句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为了更好地继续这场对话，库珀花环蹲下身。现在她们的视线平齐了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>你回忆起什么了吗？我试着打听你的家，但大家都说对你没有印象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>不过别担心，我们大多数人都是科兹洛夫团长收养的孩子。就算你继续在这里停留，他也不会介意的。他从不拒绝真正需要帮助的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>而且，我明天会去和一位很厉害的女士碰面。她见识很广，也许她听说过你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-304820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-304820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-304820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环惯于处理这样的茫然，她还记得那些无法回家的孩子刚来到马戏团时，是怎样在她和娜塔莉亚女士的安抚下露出笑容的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站起身子，往后退开一两步，向眼前的女孩儿伸出手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>对了——你瞧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指尖绽开的小小光亮为房间增添了一缕暖色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这是我的神秘术，虽然派不上什么用场，但是不是还挺漂亮的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>他们都说像星星一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-304820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-304820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-304820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>细微的亮光让女孩儿露出笑意，她看上去放松了许多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>如果你喜欢，我还可以再给你表演这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我们再试试——你能不能拼出自己的名字？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩儿打量着被推到眼前的积木块。她不知道如何写出这颗星球上的文字，于是无从分享自己的故乡与名姓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这些生物需要一个称呼来达成交流。她明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>积木块组成了一条歪歪扭扭、颜色缤纷的轨迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环尝试着将自己认识的词汇从这片彩色中打捞起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>……航行……者？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>总觉得这是你刚从收音机里挑的词……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-304820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-304820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-304820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>你也像它们一样走过很长的路，才来到米尔内吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>唔……我想想，科兹洛夫先生是怎么给我们起演出用的名称来着？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>“漫长的旅程”和“旅行”，合并起来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>——“远旅”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环伸出手，比划出她想象中旅行者号的飞行轨迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩儿思索了片刻，然后也学着伸出手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-304801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-304801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-304801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>……库珀花环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手指调转方向，她指了指自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-304801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-304801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-304801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>远旅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>你有了一个“乌特恩亚亚”风格的名字，现在你也是马戏团的一员啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>……咦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远旅忽然转头望向帐篷门口，没过几秒，脚步声和亲切的呼唤声一同响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-633401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-633401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-633401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">娜塔莉亚：</div><div>阿涅娅，你带过来的小姑娘呢？我见她总盯着动物笼子看，就从里头给她捉了只兔崽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-633401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-633401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-633401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">娜塔莉亚：</div><div>科兹洛夫让我来照顾她，你明天还得和拉普拉斯的先生女士们见面，是不是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-633401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-633401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-633401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">娜塔莉亚：</div><div>你得好好休息。就听我的，去镇上吃一顿，早点儿睡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>娜塔莉亚女士！我不需要——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-633401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-633401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-633401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">娜塔莉亚：</div><div>好啦，今晚我可没煮你那份炖菜。快去吧，科兹洛夫都给餐馆付过钱了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远旅在门和自己的朋友之间来回瞧了几次，最终还是选择了那只毛绒绒的兔子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帐篷里重归安静，只剩下满脸无奈的库珀花环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我早就不是需要被过度关心的小孩子了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>好吧，去餐馆，然后回来多做一个小时训练。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>对……就这么办。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_kafeiguan\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_kafeiguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>就这么办，老板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员合上菜单，把它推往柜台对面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>不好意思，我点完了。继续说说？你在米尔内捡到了一位小朋友，然后呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你手上的仪器很别致，这是北方哨歌留下的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>是的。来米尔内之前，我不小心在一场表演中摔下了钢丝，那时北方哨歌女士恰好在现场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>虽然记不清具体细节，但北方哨歌女士说，是我的神秘术保护了我不摔伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>她帮助我收起了身体周围的光幕，还试着分析了神秘术的原理。虽然我最后仍然没听懂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>但我记住了她用的方法，理线学。她借给我的测量仪也的确让我更容易控制自己的神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>再加上，团长也希望我能答应邀请……所以我决定明天还是去和她见一面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>挺好，她是个很不错的学者。虽然理线学基本上是纯理论内容，但实践研究也离不开理论支持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你要是真打算加入拉普拉斯，我也能给你写推荐信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>您也是拉普拉斯的研究员？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我看起来不像？奇怪，那群家伙总说我打扮得很符合他们的刻板印象，怪胎科学家之类的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>不，我还以为你们不会来吃这种普通的路边餐馆……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>拜托啦，搞研究的也是活物，得吃饭睡觉——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几条小蛇从冷周六的头发里探出身子，跟着她的笑声点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>其中一条仰着头，让库珀花环抚摸它的脑袋，鳞片的触感光滑且冰冷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你真的不怕他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我和动物们相处的时间久着呢。马戏团里有一只我自己养大的小熊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环走进店里不久，这位研究员就也进了门，径直坐在她旁边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一条小蛇率先好奇地打量起库珀花环，她也友善地和这条小蛇打了个招呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>借着这份契机，她们很快找到了共同话题。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_canguanhuitan1\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_canguanhuitan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>回到我最开始的疑问，你为什么要坚持做空中飞人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>在高空靠一根这么细的线行走，你不会害怕？还是说你觉得干这行很酷？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>嗯……我承认这是很酷。但我喜欢的其实是从空中往下望，那是平时无法体会的视角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>所有人看起来都一样。就像我在宇宙里，和无数相似的星星一同漂浮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>那不是很棒吗？不用担心是否能派上用场，只是维持住自己的光就好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>噢……的确。真有意思，我之所以跑到这个荒凉的鬼地方，就因为也有类似的念头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我要和最聪明的大脑们在一块儿，那些闪耀的、人类和神秘学家的群星。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我也想弄清楚头顶这个罩子外头有些什么玩意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>你的兄弟姐妹也这么想？这些小蛇们……啊，它们睡着了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我们从未改变想法。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_kafeiguan\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_kafeiguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员转过头，库珀花环注意到她的瞳孔收成一条细线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你的神秘术和我预想中差不多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>储存光，捕捉高能带电粒子，极光……原理类似于等离子防护罩……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>有空我会给你解释那些理论。太复杂了，一时半会讲不明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>好了，我大概清楚了。这里有一个适合你的机会，你要不要试着够到它？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>一个真正前往宇宙中的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>您——您是北方哨歌女士的那位同事？邀请我来米尔内的人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我应该早点意识到……这是您设计的测验？可是，我刚才真的把您当做一位聊得来的……朋友……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>那就太好了，你能觉得我算“朋友”，这可是我近几个月听过最好的夸奖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>谁会费尽心思设计这种测验？只是碰巧我俩都有不错的用餐品味而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>不过，为了这个奇迹般的巧合，你也该认真考虑一下邀请。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>去宇宙里？您想要让我试着做一位……宇航员……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这份邀请听起来过于遥远，即使在最不切实际的梦境里，她也没有想过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但冷周六的确认非常郑重。与此前闲聊时的态度截然不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你仍然可以明天再答复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>算着时间，我正等的那批材料也该在明天送到。或许那位送货的职员还能顺路给你捎点小礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>不用这么麻烦的，我也没有给大家准备什么东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>别紧张，你们的家乡都在这片土地上，应该能好好相处。而且他的名字和你一样有趣，怎么说来着……对了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:277%\">“命名日”。</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "CO-05"}}